### 3. Absensi Endpoints
# Statistik Admin Dashboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/statistik

### Semua Riwayat Presensi
GET http://localhost:5000/api/absensi

### Presensi Hari Ini
GET http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/hari-ini

### Status Presensi Hari Ini untuk Karyawan ID 1
GET http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/status-hari-ini/1

### Riwayat Absensi Karyawan ID 1
GET http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/riwayat/1

### Absen Masuk (Clock In)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/masuk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 2,
  "lokasi_masuk": "Dalam Radius Kantor (Graha Pratama Lt. 8)",
  "catatan": "Tepat waktu"
}

### Absen Pulang (Clock Out)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/absensi/pulang
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 2,
  "lokasi_pulang": "Dalam Radius Kantor (Graha Pratama Lt. 8)",
  "catatan": "Shift selesai"
}

### 4. Izin / Cuti Endpoints
# Ambil Semua Pengajuan Izin
GET http://localhost:5000/api/izin

### Ambil Izin per Karyawan
GET http://localhost:5000/api/izin/karyawan/2

### Ajukan Izin / Cuti
POST http://localhost:5000/api/izin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "karyawan_id": 1,
  "tanggal_mulai": "2026-09-20",
  "tanggal_selesai": "2026-09-22",
  "tipe": "Cuti Tahunan",
  "alasan": "Menghadiri acara keluarga di luar kota"
}

### Update Status Izin (Disetujui / Ditolak)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/izin/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Disetujui"
}
